    "media:imagetext": "DOOR EXITS\nFORWARD LEFT HAND DOOR ILLUSTRATED\nILUSTRACIÓN DE LA PUERTA DELANTERA DEL LADO IZQUIERDO\nILLUSTRATION DE LA PORTE AVANT GAUCHE\nM****P7\nDOOR EXITS\nEXIT\nPUERTAS DE SALIDA\nPORTES DE SORTIE\nTURAUSGANG\n1147\nMAHO\nLAND\nEVACUATION\nEvacuación en tierra\nÉvacuation par terre\nLand-Evakuierung\nPULL HANDLE IF SLIDE\nDOES NOT INFLATE\nTIRE DE LA BARRA SI EL\nTOBOGAN NO SE INFLA.\nTIREZ LA BARRE SI LE\nTOBOGGAN NE SE GONFLE PAS.\nAM GRIFF ZIEHEN, WENN SICH\nDIE RUTSCHE NICHT AUFBLÄST\nPUERTAS DE SALIDA\nPORTES DE SORTIE\nTÜRAUSGANG\n# *0\n*147\n140185471\nOVERWING EXIT\nLEFT HAND ILLUSTRATED\nILUSTRACIÓN DE LA SALIDA DE EMERGENCIA SOBRE EL ALA IZQUIERDA\nILLUSTRATION DE LA SORTIE SUR L'AILE GAUCHE\nLINKSSEITIGE ABBILDUNG\nAUSGANG ÜBER DEM FLÜGEL\nEXIT ROW SEATING\nFederal Regulations require that persons seated\nin an exit row be capable of physically opening\nIne exit. visually locating the exit. hearing oral\ninstructions to use the exit and verbally direct-\ning others to the exit. They must be able to\naccomplish these tasks without obstructing the\nexit or being preoccupied with other attentions.\nChildren under 15. pregnant or obese passen-\ngers may not sit in an exit row.\nPassengers seated in exit rows may be called\nupon to perform the following:\n• Locate, recognize and operate an emergency exit\nAssess conditions ourside an exit to assure sate egress\n• Follow the oral instructions or hand signals of a crewmember\n• Stow or secure an emergency exit door so it will not impede\nuse or tne exil\n• Assess the condition of, activate and stabilize an escape slide to\nassist others in evacuating\n• Pass expeditiously through an exit and follow a safe path away\nfrom the exit\nPassengers are required by federal regulations, to comply with\ncrewmembers in the implementation of these restrictions. If you\nare seated adiacent to an emergenev exit and cannot or do not l\nwant to perform these functions, please identify yourself to a\nFlight Attendant.\nPULL HANDLE IF SLIDE\nDOES NOT INFLATE\nTIRE DE LA BARRA SI EL\nTOBOGÁN NO SE INFLA.\nTIREZ LA BARRE SI LE\nTOBOGGAN NE SE GONFLE PAS.\nAM GRIFF ZIEHEN, WENN SICH\nDIE RUTSCHE NICHT AUFBLAST\n*71E718\nWATER\nEVACUATION\nEvacuación por agua\nÉvacuation par mer\nWasser-Evakuierung\n* EM\n* 1 x\n700000",
